---
import Card from "./Card.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden px-6 md:h-screen">
  <div class="about-inner scene-inner relative mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-6xl items-center">
    <h2
      class="about-heading text-fg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[clamp(5rem,14vw,13rem)] leading-none font-bold"
    >
      About
    </h2>
    <div class="about-body relative z-10 flex max-w-xl flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="text-fg-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <span class="about-line block">Webアプリケーションを中心に、</span>
        <span class="about-line block">企画から実装まで一貫してつくるのが好きです。</span>
        <span class="about-line block">日々の学びや制作の記録もこのサイトに残しています。</span>
      </p>
      <Card href="/about" class="about-card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-fg group-hover:text-accent-bright text-lg font-bold transition-colors">
              自己紹介を見る
            </p>
            <p class="text-fg-subtle mt-1 text-sm">経歴・スキル・興味関心について</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-accent inline-block transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">
            →
          </span>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
